Bundle-Description: Creates a Liferay MVCBean Spring portlet as a WAR project with Thymeleaf views.
Bundle-Name: Liferay Project Templates MVCBean Spring Thymeleaf Portlet
Bundle-SymbolicName: com.liferay.project.templates.mvcbean.spring.thymeleaf.portlet
Bundle-Version: 1.0.0
Liferay-Versions: [7.2,8)
-removeheaders:\
	Import-Package,\
	Private-Package,\
	Require-Capability